  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_steel_cb16967db6a240c8065a85a1dbb05b664ed1401efeeb21b96189240cbb690ad1d96">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>steel: a hard iron-carbon alloy (Latin calibs). Steel was also worked into mirrors (steel glass - see looking glass), caskets, crossbow laths (see crossbow lath) and helmets.</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
